SOP-01: Supplier Verification, Anti-Fraud & Purchasing Protocol
Objective: Ensure UK merchant legitimacy, prevent scam storefronts, avoid drop-shipped knockoffs, and ensure valid manufacturer invoices.
Protocol:
Retailer Whitelisting:
