Protocol:
48-Hour DDP Clearance: Consignment arrives at Murtala Muhammed Airport Cargo Terminal (MMA). Partner clearing agent executes clearance under the Courier Simplified Clearance Manifest. All terminal handling fees and customs duties are prepaid on a consolidated per-kg tariff.
